~ start
if DataManager.get_flag("got_quest") == true:
	=> quest_got

if QuestManager.completed_quests.has(Danny.quest):
	=> quest_completed

Danny: Welcome to the FRESH testing grounds! This is a [shake]HEAVY[/shake] work in progress, so expect this place to become pretty later.
Danny: There are some things I think you should test out, starting with the Arena. [if QuestManager.get_active_quest_current_step() == 0][$> QuestManager.update_quest()][/if][$> DataManager.set_flag("got_quest", true)]

=> END

~ quest_got
Danny: You already got my quest!
=> END

~ quest_completed
Danny: Thank you for playing this ship :D

=> END